    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Commercial and fashion film director (writes and directs), Paris-born, trained at SVA New York, now listed in Los Angeles. Signed to MindsEye (London) since 2021 and Groupe Premiere Heure (Paris); also runs 1/33 Productions. Work for Zara (MindsEye calls her Zara's go-to creative), Dior, Bergdorf Goodman, Max Mara, A.P.C., Nike, RE/DONE x Ford; comedic, character-led style. THE GIRLS HAVE SPOKEN won a 2021 Webby (viral video); her SVA short Take a Deep Breath won NBR and NYWIFT awards. The clipped reel (Valentine's Day 2026, BREAK UP WITH THEM, starring @harperraeels, about 1M likes) is her own work. Seniority: senior director, about 11 years. Autonomy 4: repeatedly writes and directs brand films for major fashion clients (inferred from credits, no first-hand evidence). Freelance: repped director per the MindsEye roster and LinkedIn. Work captured from her Vimeo (javajacobs.com currently renders with broken image assets, see the Website shot), with video thumbnails above the playable embeds.",
